{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "2 分钟": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2 minutes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "5 分钟": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 minutes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "60 秒": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "60 seconds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU 与内存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CPU & Memory"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU 使用率趋势": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CPU usage trend"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU、内存、磁盘和网络指标只在本机内存中处理。PulseBar 不保存历史、不建立外部网络连接，也不包含广告或分析 SDK。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CPU, memory, disk, and network metrics are processed only in local memory. PulseBar does not persist history, make external network connections, or include advertising or analytics SDKs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I/O 速率不可用，容量仍可正常读取": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I/O rates are unavailable; capacity is still available"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "PulseBar 已恢复到菜单栏": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PulseBar has been restored to the menu bar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CPU %@，内存 %@，下载 %@，上传 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CPU %1$@, memory %2$@, download %3$@, upload %4$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ %@，%@ %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ %2$@, %3$@ %4$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 个逻辑核心": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld logical cores"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld分钟": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld min"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld小时 %lld分": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld hr %2$lld min"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld天 %lld小时": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld d %2$lld hr"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 会将空闲内存用于缓存，空闲较少不一定异常。PulseBar 的占用值由公开 VM 计数器近似计算；内存压力、压缩与交换空间通常更能反映系统是否紧张。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS uses free memory for caching, so low free memory is not necessarily a problem. PulseBar approximates usage from public VM counters; memory pressure, compression, and swap usually better reflect system stress."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上移": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下移": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move down"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上下拖动右侧手柄调整顺序。至少保留一个模块；磁盘仅在完整密度中显示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag the handle on the right vertically to reorder. Keep at least one module enabled; Disk appears only at Full density."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上下拖动调整模块顺序": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
