            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果菜单栏空间不足，macOS 可能会暂时隐藏部分项目。你可以使用简洁密度或减少显示模块。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When menu bar space is limited, macOS may temporarily hide some items. Use Compact density or show fewer modules."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完整": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Complete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "实时预览": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Live preview"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "容量与速率": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capacity & rates"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "容量使用文件系统报告的普通可用空间，不计入可能触发额外扫描的可清除空间；因此可能与 Finder 略有差异。读写速率来自块存储累计计数器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capacity uses ordinary free space reported by the file system and excludes purgeable space that can require an extra scan, so it may differ slightly from Finder. Read and write rates come from cumulative block-storage counters."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密度": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Density"
          }
        }
      }
    },
